  "description": "The archaeological area of Piano (or Quarto) di Comunit\u00e0 is an area of Etrusco-Roman Veii where there is evidence for a Republican domus that is modified during the Augustan period. The area is then used as a necropolis in Late Antiquity (fourth and fifth centuries).",
